      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SALTY SNOOP (4) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing second (24.63) at Bendigo. Solid record at the distance winning five races. Good form should continue. PAW KIPLIN (6) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish second (24.73) at Bendigo in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 over 425m. Expected to be in the finish again. LILLY'S WISH (3) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at this track over 390m behind Mana's Way (23.29) in a Grade 5. Worth following up. ASTON KRISTEN (2) generally performs well over this distance.",
